@node Configuration
@chapter Configuration
@cindex configuration

You can configure @value{PROJECT} by placing a @defterm{manifest file} named @file{nova.toml} in your project root.

@menu
* Config Keys::        Supported fields in nova.toml.
* Environment::        Environment variable overrides.
@end menu

@node Config Keys
@section Config Keys

@table @code
@item @cfgkey{opt_level}
Sets the optimization tier (`0` to `3`).

@item @cfgkey{target_arch}
Overrides the default host architecture.
@end table

@warning{Setting @cfgkey{opt_level} to @code{3} significantly increases compile times.}

@node Environment
@section Environment

Any key in @file{nova.toml} can be overridden by prefixing its uppercase name with @code{NOVAC_}.
